<title>USA: Lucent Technologies gets $35 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Lucent Technologies gets $35 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>CTI Movil, a cellular network operator in Argentina, said Wednesday it has awarded Lucent Technologies Inc a $35 million contract to expand its wireless advanced mobile phone service and to install an online billing platform.</p>
<p>CTI said it expected installation to be completed over the next six months.</p>
<p>The project will increase CTI's network by 25 percent. It currently has 125,000 subscribers in the interior of Argentina.</p>
</text>
